		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-11" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The undersigned hereby appoints James Rolke and Chester S. Zygmont, III as proxies of the undersigned to attend the Special Meeting of Stockholders (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-11" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;">Special Meeting</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#x201d;) of Revelation Biosciences, Inc. (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-11" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;">Company</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#x201d;), to be held via teleconference as described in the Proxy Statement on January 20, 2023 at </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">12</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">:00 </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">p</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">.m. Eastern </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Time</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, and any postponement or adjournment thereof, and to vote as if the undersigned were then and there personally present on all matters set forth in the Notice of Special Meeting, dated December </FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">30</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, 2022 (the &#x201c;</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-11" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;">Notice</FONT><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">&#x201d;), a copy of which has been received by the undersigned, as follows:</FONT></P>
