		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-4" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Number of attendees: ____________</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-4" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-11" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;">PLEASE NOTE:</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-4" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;text-align:justify;widows:2;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-10" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">STOCKHOLDER SHOULD SIGN THE PROXY PROMPTLY AND RETURN IT IN THE ENCLOSED ENVELOPE AS SOON AS POSSIBLE TO ENSURE THAT IT IS RECEIVED BEFORE THE SPECIAL MEETING. PLEASE INDICATE ANY ADDRESS OR TELEPHONE NUMBER CHANGES IN THE SPACE BELOW.</FONT></P>
		</DIV>

